SUMMARY:Now accepting Artists! 
DESCRIPTION:Petaluma Figure Drawing Meetup Group\n| Suite G Studio is acce
 pting artist to exhibit work for Sonoma County's Art at the Source\, Satur
 day June 6th and 7th\, 10am - 5pm. |\n| ----------------------------------
 --------------------------------------------------------------------------
 -------------------- |\n|\n\n| Exhibiting artists will be given 6 feet of 
 linear space to hang their art in any way they choose. Artists can also se
 t up a tables or racks to display their work. The exhibit will be open the
  entire weekend. For more information\, or to apply\, email suitegstudio62
 0@gmail.com Cost $200 |\n| -----------------------------------------------
 --------------------------------------------------------------------------
 --------------------------------------------------------------------------
 --------------------------------------------------------------------------
 --------------- |\n|\n\n**for More information go to [Art Show!](Figure Dr
 awing @Suite G Studio THIS Wednesday 4/22 6:30pm - 8:30pm 620 Petaluma Blv
 d. N Join us for an evening of creativity and inspiration at the Petaluma 
 Figure Drawing Night at Suite G Studio! Whether you're a seasoned artist o
 r just starting out\, this event is the perfect opportunity to hone your s
 kills\, meet fellow artists\, and immerse yourself in the world of figurat
 ive painting. Our life drawing sessions are open to artists and art lovers
  of all levels\, so don't be shy to join us and express your creativity on
  paper. We provide a supportive and encouraging environment where everyone
  can feel comfortable exploring their artistic talents. BECOME A MEMBER of
  Suite G Studio for $40/month. Or RSVP by sending $25 to @suiteg on Venmo 
 or email suitegstudio620@gmail.com Be prepared for an evening filled with 
 sketching\, painting\, and drawing as we focus on capturing the human form
  in all its beauty and complexity. This event is a great opportunity to pr
 actice your figure drawing techniques and unleash your artistic potential.
  Whether you prefer using pencils\, charcoal\, pastels\, or paint\, there'
 s something for everyone at our Figure Drawing Night. Come and be a part o
 f our community of artists dedicated to celebrating and expressing the bea
 uty of life through art.)**
